{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;People You May Know?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Thursday night, and Ritsu has just returned from work.<br>Today was the day\u2014Ritsu finally got a smartphone.<br>While getting used to the new screen, a familiar name appeared: a close friend from school<i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.apng?t=1772353966\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.poster.avif?t=1772353966\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/d23e40c9456dbdfce46fc983fc125def.webp?t=1772353966\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weekend story that begins with a single message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chat choices, caf\u00e9 orders, map navigation, and other apps added one by one,<br>this freshly bought smartphone becomes a companion for reconnecting,<br>bringing color to the moments spent together again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel where you navigate apps to meet up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/34c4b33789e2a2dbfcd5781392261485.avif?t=1772353966\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/68a7059cd06353a9d261465467aa7694.webp?t=1772353966\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that simple suggestion\u2014&quot;People You May Know?&quot;\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/2ffa029b2d0aaab040680a8dbee6e32f.avif?t=1772353966\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritsu gathers the courage to message Saku on Thursday night.<br>Surprised, nostalgic, and a little nervous,<br>they begin a weekend of meet-ups, from Friday to Sunday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The table you choose, the drinks you order, and each small conversation\u2014<br>every detail gently brings old memories back to life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576890?t=1772353966","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3576890?t=1772353966","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/9e8e405d2ada5fbff40c21120515a7fe07c0af1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772353966","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/9e8e405d2ada5fbff40c21120515a7fe07c0af1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772353966","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;People You May Know?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s Thursday night, and Ritsu has just returned from work.<br>Today was the day\u2014Ritsu finally got a smartphone.<br>While getting used to the new screen, a familiar name appeared: a close friend from school<i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.apng?t=1772353966\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/0ae66e2cd656b164a522b219a83fa201.poster.avif?t=1772353966\" class=\"bb_img\" width=640 height=360 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/d23e40c9456dbdfce46fc983fc125def.webp?t=1772353966\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A weekend story that begins with a single message.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chat choices, caf\u00e9 orders, map navigation, and other apps added one by one,<br>this freshly bought smartphone becomes a companion for reconnecting,<br>bringing color to the moments spent together again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel where you navigate apps to meet up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/34c4b33789e2a2dbfcd5781392261485.avif?t=1772353966\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/68a7059cd06353a9d261465467aa7694.webp?t=1772353966\" width=650 height=45 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that simple suggestion\u2014&quot;People You May Know?&quot;\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/extras/2ffa029b2d0aaab040680a8dbee6e32f.avif?t=1772353966\" width=640 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritsu gathers the courage to message Saku on Thursday night.<br>Surprised, nostalgic, and a little nervous,<br>they begin a weekend of meet-ups, from Friday to Sunday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The table you choose, the drinks you order, and each small conversation\u2014<br>every detail gently brings old memories back to life.</p>","developers":["Paochanz","Tenten"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576890/f50ab5270331aa78572da0d0c36fb540121bcfbb/header.jpg?t=1772353966","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> High Sierra 10.13+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Metal capable Intel and AMD GPUs<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Apple officially supported drivers. For development: IL2CPP scripting backend requires Xcode. Targeting Apple Silicon with IL2CPP scripting backend requires macOS Catalina 10.15.4 and Xcode 12.2 or newer.</li></ul>"},"name":"Let's Meet","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+) and Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Hardware vendor officially supported drivers. For development: IL2CPP scripting backend requires Visual Studio 2015 with C++ Tools component or later and Windows 10 SDK.</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Paochanz"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Atos criminosos","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_